{"name":"Poppy","hex":"#c23c47","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Poppy","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from English, a flower name used since the end of the 19th century."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Alternative form of poppy (“father, grandfather, or other male authority figure of a similar standing”).","Former U.S. president George H. W. Bush"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Poppy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Poppy","blocks":[{"text":"A poppy is a flowering plant in the subfamily Papaveroideae of the family Papaveraceae. Poppies are herbaceous plants, often grown for their colourful flowers. One species of poppy, Papaver somniferum, is the source of the narcotic drug mixture opium, which contains powerful medicinal alkaloids such as morphine and has been used since ancient times as an analgesic and narcotic medicinal and recreational drug. It also produces edible seeds. Following the trench warfare in the poppy fields of Flanders, Belgium, during World War I, poppies, specifically the red poppy, have become a symbol of remembrance of soldiers who have died during wartime, especially in the UK, Canada, Australia, Africa and other Commonwealth realms."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Poppies_in_the_Sunset_on_Lake_Geneva.jpg/330px-Poppies_in_the_Sunset_on_Lake_Geneva.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poppy","wikidata":"Q967457"},{"title":"Poppy (singer)","blocks":[{"text":"Moriah Rose Pereira, known professionally as Poppy, is an American singer, songwriter, musician, and YouTuber. She earned recognition for her performance art videos on YouTube beginning in 2014, in which she played an uncanny valley-like android satirizing Internet culture and modern society. She collaborated with Titanic Sinclair during this period, and ended the partnership in 2019 after accusing him of emotional abuse. She launched the web series Improbably Poppy in 2024. She is known for her experimentation and versatility within her artistry, public image, and music."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Poppy_%40_The_Wiltern_08_24_2023_%2853407382618%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Poppy_%40_The_Wiltern_08_24_2023_%2853407382618%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poppy_(singer)","wikidata":"Q24852571"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg/500px-A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg/1280px-A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg/500px-A_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A close-up of a red-flowered poppy","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_bright_red_poppy_flower.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg/500px-Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg/1280px-Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg/500px-Persian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wild poppy in Behbahan","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APersian_Poppy%2C_Behbahan.jpg"},{"srcset":"h